    "source_consumers": "CPointList::Read consumes all nine authored gun point records in model 85. The optimized model path caps its gun slots to MAX_GUNS separately. LoadGameData reaches per-level replacements before the mission root. LoadHiresModel attempts ASE then OOF and advances past an unavailable optional custom replacement. LoadOOFModel tries the named alias and then modelN.oof. All seven numeric keys appear directly in replacementModels with flip-V set. Observe which original members install and which consumers they reach before changing the port's policy.",
    "observation": "The pinned CModel::Read follows decoded data for known chunks and uses declared length for unknown chunks. Six original models overstate TXTR length; a bounded local parser experiment reached GPNT rather than producing a playable level. The seventh retained GRND; all seven have PANI and RANI. No runtime admission was changed.",
    "cluster_outcomes": "The three split-Anthology advertised ordinals remain load_failed at original inputs; the separate anthology.7z entry also remains load_failed. This audit makes no census gain."
